                <invention-title lang="de">AUF EINER STÜTZSTANGE MONTIERTES SYSTEM UND VERFAHREN ZUR MINIMALEN NAHANZEIGE FÜR EIN FAHRGESCHÄFT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME MONTÉ SUR UNE BARRE DE SUPPORT ET PROCÉDÉ D'INDICATION DE PROXIMITÉ MINIMALE POUR VÉHICULE DE MANÈGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SUPPORT BAR MOUNTED SYSTEM AND METHOD OF MINIMUM CLOSE INDICATION FOR RIDE VEHICLE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A system for indicating a restraint system configuration includes a ride seat of a ride vehicle, and a restraint system configured to restrain a passenger in the ride seat. The restraint system includes a crossbar restraint, a restraint support bar that is rotatable relative to the ride seat and configured to transition the crossbar restraint between an engaged configuration and a disengaged configuration, and a position indicator coupled to the restraint support bar. The position indicator includes a visual marker configured to transition between a visible position unencumbered by a concealment structure in the disengaged configuration of the crossbar restraint, and a concealed position behind the concealment structure in the engaged configuration of the crossbar restraint.</p>
            </abstract>
